# Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env for local development

# Vite Environment Variables (must start with VITE_)
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
# VITE_APP_NAME=Zustand React App
# VITE_ENVIRONMENT=development

# Azure Static Web Apps automatically provides:
# - AZURE_STATIC_WEB_APPS_API_TOKEN (in CI/CD only)
# - Add any custom variables in Azure Portal → Settings → Configuration

# Note: Never commit .env file with real secrets!
